#: scenario7:scenario7_358AC0A5_A147_437B_A33A_EE45E9E7EACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec7abb3fdd17b7c3fe09243ffacb24553f208854bb257aa11c12bf7a7181db0c
