msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And who was it who went about inviting everyone he came across again? ⟪k:3⟫Who "
"⟪k:4⟫are⟪k:5⟫ those people?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫А кто, скажи на милость, приглашал сюда каждого встречного? ⟪k:3⟫Кто ⟪k:4⟫эти⟪k:5⟫ "
"люди?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E0A2FE24_2970_4355_B584_86B368FD6442
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45f097c44d135abec12cb9a18b084a1670955dc30cda9e463f141b8a0db3ad37
