msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Жорж, я не—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8542D06D_E8EC_4D69_AA11_A3D0E2DB61C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e08abbe09fcdc4730c1953d2a62ea6a4eadc35f2c420d26b9a382c5e2e0484e
