msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_63A27718_1534_4325_815D_63CF8112160E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c70ded72755b55c17ee9e297a97a8fd6bb23fa5536a269ac2df0cace90f3d58f
