#: scenario7:scenario7_87EC99C0_B5CC_4789_AC25_1ED76DE8EE20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68558ab34f35e1b711f229c20070b9252d60c7b2de0d2ebbb15c84ecd82949b2
